  "_comment": "Per-machine settings. Copy to models.local.json. plans: none|free|pro|max (missing vendor = pro; none removes the vendor, free moves it last in the default order). models.<id>.enabled false hides a model, true skips the availability check. available lists the ids the vendor CLI really offers (agy ids include the effort suffix); a vendor with no entry is assumed to offer everything. roles.<role> may set model, effort, vendor and grade.",
